],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FQQHQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"76576d6c-fa51-4402-b746-a4e60b340b6b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"日本だと創作以外ではそこまで嫌われてない印象","ts":"1622118454.038500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mEF/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2d988a7-2ede-43ad-bd4a-66e6bf9e217f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"詩的だな","ts":"1622118442.038400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YCWq6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"53ed0458-ed3e-4ed9-89e9-2c53e7f8175e","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"あと英語は同じ言葉の繰り返しを嫌うので一つの表現に対して何個も言い回しを調べていて、それもまたつらい","ts":"1622118389.038200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bvkO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e8d64a0-0158-462d-828a-93a2e189b8ae","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"NRS起こしてる……","ts":"1622118374.037900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ninja-doron","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ICv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"503f5152-6577-42f6-8a07-7f7f904a6650","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"アイエエエ","ts":"1622118318.037000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ml2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a199b8f2-baa7-475b-8bfe-75cea13870fa","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"インドの人と会話してたとき、IEEE1394を「アイトリプルイーいちさんきゅうよん」とよく言ってしまう人が(自分ふくめ)おおかったので、終盤はインドの人は単語を覚えてしまったw","ts":"1622118266.036800","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1622118377.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Uiz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f6457ca-96b9-4315-b6c3-a657689c6858","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"英語はかなり単語の係り受けの解釈がしっかりするだろうから日-\u0026gt;英よりは英-\u0026gt;日のほうが制度いいかな?","ts":"1622118221.035800","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1622118284.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mOKxy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12b97ee0-cdf8-4b79-8755-02d7cd6e9ce9","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"やってますやってます。かなり長い文章を苦労して英語に翻訳して、DeepL で訳し戻して「機械翻訳スゲ〜〜〜」って感動したりしてます（そこじゃない）","ts":"1622118167.035200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Dk9t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fc0e636-ed28-44ad-88ce-04c7691e5b68","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"むずかしい","ts":"1622117984.034600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5D34"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a78bc0d-8645-41e9-9dc4-a019213056a0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"英語から日本語への機械翻訳にもかけつつやるしかないですね...(そこであまりに変になったらミスということで)","ts":"1622117966.034300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8u9w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72e317ff-fcc4-453f-a796-8ec2f5b59d70","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"長大な日本語のドキュメントを英語に翻訳しているのですが、これネイティブがみたらありえんほど不自然な表現や文法ミスがあるんだろうなあ、とおもうとかなりげんなりしますね","ts":"1622117861.033600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JEt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90f6e8f3-0d3c-4b3e-9ea9-49f613be608c","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"IPv lock","ts":"1622116722.032700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+bqXA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b909e47-